<title>USA: Sled Dogs Co Q2 Dec 31 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Sled Dogs Co Q2 Dec 31 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended December 31</p>
<p>					    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $1,329,125	$  504,866</p>
<p> Net loss			   (1,247,467)	 (808,145)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share	   (0.09)	    (0.09)</p>
<p> Average shares  (1)(2)	  13,153,193	 9,054,347</p>
<p>					Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>					    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales			    1,414,428	   876,330</p>
<p> Net loss			   (2,300,429)     (1,482,023)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share	   (0.18)	    (0.23)</p>
