<p>(1) Actual shares of common stock issued and outstanding at December 31, 1996 were 13,153,513.  The weighted average number of shares outstanding reflect the exercise of 1,763,194 common stock warrants during the period July 15, 1996 to August 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(2) Actual shares of common stock issued and outstanding at December 31, 1995 were 11,749,999.  The weighted average number of shares outstanding reflect the issuance of 8,000,000 shares on November 1, 1995 in a private placement of equity.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
